Note on bundled data:

`tools/moe_cross_strait.json` is derived from the Appendix "兩岸常用詞語對照表"
of the Concised Mandarin Chinese Dictionary (國語辭典簡編本), published by the
Ministry of Education, Republic of China (Taiwan).
Source: https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/appendix.jsp?ID=54

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository. The dictionary data
remains subject to its own terms as published by the Ministry of Education.
